      answer: Peter explains the finding and practical next step. Follow-up receives a separate fixed-price quote or repair referral. Ordinary configuration of an existing accessible manufacturer account may be included while you enter your credentials. Account creation or recovery, subscription purchase or management, service outages and bypassing account or device controls are excluded.
